<title>USA: MFS signs interconnect agreements.</title>
<headline>MFS signs interconnect agreements.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>MFS Communications Co Inc said Monday it entered into local telephone service co-carrier interconnection agreements with Sprint Corp in Florida and Illinois.</p>
<p>MFS said it is the first carrier to reach a comprehensive interconnection agreement with Sprint based on the Telecommunications Act of 1996. It has reached agreements with six of the seven Regional Bell Operating Companies.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
